{"3966570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spot Zero", "steam_appid": 3966570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/a7e9b85c1721953238eb144b571ab820.avif?t=1772188858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras_big/a7e9b85c1721953238eb144b571ab820.avif?t=1772188858 width=1560 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spot Zero is a mission-driven anime action RPG where you lead a squad of Human and Yokai investigators to break through monster-controlled zones, secure new outposts, and push the frontline outward. Each character brings a distinct combat style, blade clashes, parry waves, grappling hooks, TPS mode and elemental bursts, as you uncover the truth behind the world’s downfall.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>World Overview</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After the arrival of the Abyssal Gods, cities fell and nations vanished. Only scattered towns built by Humans and Yokai remain, fragile bastions standing against an endless tide of monsters.</strong><br>While these last sanctuaries fight to survive, the Investigation Corps ventures into the unknown, mapping hostile territories, cutting through monster-controlled zones, and assembling outposts to reclaim the land inch by inch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Corps’ Mentor</strong>, tasked with training elite investigators, organizing their missions, and leading them into the heart of the crisis in search of the truth behind the world’s collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/f4beb59cc0d1ede8b55dac3cd8b23bae.avif?t=1772188858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras_big/f4beb59cc0d1ede8b55dac3cd8b23bae.avif?t=1772188858 width=1560 height=840 /></span><i> </i><br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Lead a squad of Human and Yokai investigators</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train, manage, and deploy a diverse team of Human and Yokai fighters, each carrying unique abilities and personalities. As the Corps’ Mentor, you coordinate missions, prepare your squad, and guide them through operations that determine the fate of the remaining survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/7692bd90234cd7cccc8bb91aa3a2394a.poster.avif?t=1772188858\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/7692bd90234cd7cccc8bb91aa3a2394a.webm?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/7692bd90234cd7cccc8bb91aa3a2394a.mp4?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Experience high-impact combat with unique character styles</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character fights differently, whether it’s blade clashes, parry waves, grappling-hook mobility, precise TPS aiming, or elemental bursts. Swap between investigators and create fluid, fast-paced combat chains tailored to each mission’s challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/fa301a303f2a50c2ee7b6a22aa16cdf7.poster.avif?t=1772188858\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/fa301a303f2a50c2ee7b6a22aa16cdf7.webm?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/fa301a303f2a50c2ee7b6a22aa16cdf7.mp4?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Unleash the Spot Zero Domain for squad-wide power</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge team energy to activate the Spot Zero Domain, freezing enemy time and bringing your entire squad onto the battlefield. Enter a match-3 tactical mode, build combo energy, and unleash devastating fusion skills based on your score and elemental composition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/b3e803abc554dc31f6492198a420b362.poster.avif?t=1772188858\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/b3e803abc554dc31f6492198a420b362.webm?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/b3e803abc554dc31f6492198a420b362.mp4?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Face massive bosses with dynamic weak-point systems</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle towering monsters with breakable weak points, stagger windows, arena interactions, and multi-phase mechanics. Learn each boss’s patterns and exploit their vulnerabilities to shatter limbs, disrupt attacks, and turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/ec1eee89770f1886e829d3a7f0e9605b.poster.avif?t=1772188858\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/ec1eee89770f1886e829d3a7f0e9605b.webm?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/ec1eee89770f1886e829d3a7f0e9605b.mp4?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your Destiny Awaits</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/b9db07e5bfb88205a17a4e1c7a6a79e3.poster.avif?t=1772188858\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/b9db07e5bfb88205a17a4e1c7a6a79e3.webm?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/b9db07e5bfb88205a17a4e1c7a6a79e3.mp4?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every outpost you claim brings you closer to the source of the invasion. Lead your squad, carve a path through the frontline, and uncover the truth that will decide the world’s last hope.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/a7e9b85c1721953238eb144b571ab820.avif?t=1772188858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras_big/a7e9b85c1721953238eb144b571ab820.avif?t=1772188858 width=1560 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spot Zero is a mission-driven anime action RPG where you lead a squad of Human and Yokai investigators to break through monster-controlled zones, secure new outposts, and push the frontline outward. Each character brings a distinct combat style, blade clashes, parry waves, grappling hooks, TPS mode and elemental bursts, as you uncover the truth behind the world’s downfall.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>World Overview</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After the arrival of the Abyssal Gods, cities fell and nations vanished. Only scattered towns built by Humans and Yokai remain, fragile bastions standing against an endless tide of monsters.</strong><br>While these last sanctuaries fight to survive, the Investigation Corps ventures into the unknown, mapping hostile territories, cutting through monster-controlled zones, and assembling outposts to reclaim the land inch by inch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Corps’ Mentor</strong>, tasked with training elite investigators, organizing their missions, and leading them into the heart of the crisis in search of the truth behind the world’s collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/f4beb59cc0d1ede8b55dac3cd8b23bae.avif?t=1772188858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras_big/f4beb59cc0d1ede8b55dac3cd8b23bae.avif?t=1772188858 width=1560 height=840 /></span><i> </i><br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Lead a squad of Human and Yokai investigators</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train, manage, and deploy a diverse team of Human and Yokai fighters, each carrying unique abilities and personalities. As the Corps’ Mentor, you coordinate missions, prepare your squad, and guide them through operations that determine the fate of the remaining survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/7692bd90234cd7cccc8bb91aa3a2394a.poster.avif?t=1772188858\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/7692bd90234cd7cccc8bb91aa3a2394a.webm?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/7692bd90234cd7cccc8bb91aa3a2394a.mp4?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Experience high-impact combat with unique character styles</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character fights differently, whether it’s blade clashes, parry waves, grappling-hook mobility, precise TPS aiming, or elemental bursts. Swap between investigators and create fluid, fast-paced combat chains tailored to each mission’s challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/fa301a303f2a50c2ee7b6a22aa16cdf7.poster.avif?t=1772188858\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/fa301a303f2a50c2ee7b6a22aa16cdf7.webm?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/fa301a303f2a50c2ee7b6a22aa16cdf7.mp4?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Unleash the Spot Zero Domain for squad-wide power</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge team energy to activate the Spot Zero Domain, freezing enemy time and bringing your entire squad onto the battlefield. Enter a match-3 tactical mode, build combo energy, and unleash devastating fusion skills based on your score and elemental composition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/b3e803abc554dc31f6492198a420b362.poster.avif?t=1772188858\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/b3e803abc554dc31f6492198a420b362.webm?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/b3e803abc554dc31f6492198a420b362.mp4?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Face massive bosses with dynamic weak-point systems</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle towering monsters with breakable weak points, stagger windows, arena interactions, and multi-phase mechanics. Learn each boss’s patterns and exploit their vulnerabilities to shatter limbs, disrupt attacks, and turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/ec1eee89770f1886e829d3a7f0e9605b.poster.avif?t=1772188858\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/ec1eee89770f1886e829d3a7f0e9605b.webm?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966570/extras/ec1eee89770f1886e829d3a7f0e9605b.mp4?t=1772188858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your Destiny Awaits</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im